---
layout: layouts/pt.njk
lang: de
title: Artikel
description: "Artikel über Communities, Developer Relations, Partnerschaften und KI, aus Gesprächen, Forschung und unserer eigenen Praxis."
permalink: /de/public-thinking/
navActive: pt
eleventyComputed:
  extraHead:
    - "<link rel='alternate' hreflang='de' href='https://communitygeeks.ai/de/public-thinking/'><link rel='alternate' hreflang='en' href='https://communitygeeks.ai/public-thinking/'><link rel='alternate' hreflang='x-default' href='https://communitygeeks.ai/public-thinking/'>"
    - "<script type='application/ld+json'>{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://communitygeeks.ai/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Artikel\",\"item\":\"https://communitygeeks.ai/de/public-thinking/\"}]}</script>"
    - "{{ publicThinkingCollectionDe | safe }}"
extraScripts:
  - public-thinking-filter.js
---
{# PUBLIC THINKING INDEX (DE) inside the concept shell: the live German
   index's composition and texts, links pointing at concept article pages. #}
{% from "partials/pt-card-base.njk" import ptCardBase %}
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="pt-crumb" aria-label="Brotkrumen"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Artikel</span></nav>
    <div class="page-hero-row">
      <div class="page-eyebrow">
        {% include "partials/node-mark.njk" %}
        Artikel
      </div>
      <div class="pt-lang-switch">
        <a href="/public-thinking/" hreflang="en" lang="en">EN</a> <span class="active" aria-current="page">DE</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Was wir aus unserer Arbeit lernen.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">Artikel über Communities, Developer Relations, Partnerschaften und KI, aus Gesprächen, Forschung und unserer eigenen Praxis. Jeder Artikel zeigt, wie gut seine Schlussfolgerungen belegt sind.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap">
  <aside class="research-teaser" aria-labelledby="research-teaser-title">
    <p class="research-teaser-label">Forschung in Arbeit</p>
    <h2 id="research-teaser-title">Wann Wissen aus der Praxis in KI-Antworten auftaucht</h2>
    <p>{{ researchTeaser.de }}</p>
  </aside>
  {% set availableFormats = publicThinkingFormats | publishedFormats(publicThinkingDe) %}
  {% if availableFormats.length > 1 %}
  <div class="filter-bar" role="group" aria-label="Nach Format filtern">
    <button class="filter-pill active" type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">Alle</button>
    {% for f in availableFormats %}
    <button class="filter-pill" type="button" data-filter="{{ f.filterType }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ f.labelDe }}</button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {% endif %}
  <div class="pt-grid">
    {% for piece in publicThinkingDe %}{{ ptCardBase(piece, loop.index, 2, "de", "", loop.first) }}{% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="pt-compact-empty" data-type="research">Weitere Forschungsergebnisse sind in Arbeit und erscheinen hier, sobald sie das Review durchlaufen haben.</div>
  <p class="pt-compact-empty pt-none" id="ledger-empty" hidden>In diesem Format ist noch nichts veröffentlicht.</p>
</div>

<section class="pt-shell-close">
  <div class="wrap pt-shell-close-row">
    <p class="pt-shell-close-h">Sprechen wir über Ihr Projekt.</p>
    <div class="pt-shell-close-actions">
      <a href="/contact/" class="kctl"><span class="kctl-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="kctl-row"><span class="kctl-label">Projekt besprechen</span><span class="kctl-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a>
      <a href="/#approach" class="pt-shell-quiet">So arbeiten wir →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
